        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roundabout, concrete pavement, complete pavement structure</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roundabout, concrete pavement, complete pavement structure
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: ad5fc0c9-4936-4426-9b5f-220ebc4b29d4
This dataset combines the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of all layer types of 1 m2 roundabouts (concrete pavement) in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Predicted service life of 80 years, process inculdes replacement of pavement layers after the individual service life has been reached
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ad5fc0c9-4936-4426-9b5f-220ebc4b29d4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
